Z||000000||3400Fiero||07-24-2000||09:32 PM||||I recently put a 3400 in my Fiero and I must say that I LOVE this engine!  It has an awesome sound and performs sooo well!!  I used my friend's G-Tech, and found that I was getting 0-60 times of 5.6 sec, and 1/4 mile times of 14.1 sec at 104 MPH.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> To me, that is amazing, partly because my clutch isn't the best.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"><P>Anyone else out there who has a 3400?  ||||reg||1
