Z||000004||3400Fiero||07-25-2000||09:13 AM||||The engine is a 3400 DOHC from a 1995 Monte Carlo.  I did the conversion myself, so nearly all the money was spent on the engine.  I am creating a website to document the conversion.  This is a very easy conversion to do. I don't think the kits out there are worth the money.  Maybe that's a bit presumptuous, because you do have to have the patience to combine the wiring harnesses, but all that info will be on my website when I get it done!   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>------------------<BR>1988 Fiero 3400DOHC<BR>||||reg||10
