Z||000008||3400Fiero||07-27-2000||10:18 AM||||How have you tackled any mixture adjustments?[/B][/QUOTE]<P>I haven't had any troubles with mixture per se.  The engine does have a bit of a lope at idle, partly because the ECM expects it to have the load of the auto tranny, partly because I retarded the exhaust valve timing by ~2 degrees.<BR>||||reg||1
